Third-party material included in this repository
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

src/novatrees/chm_watershed.py is a Python port of the crown-detection stage
of Point-Cloud-Tools (PCT), authored by Dr. Tuomas Yrttimaa, University of
Eastern Finland:

  Yrttimaa, T. (2021). Automatic Point Cloud Processing Tools to Characterize
  Trees (Point-Cloud-Tools). Zenodo. https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.5779288
  Original released under CC BY 4.0.

  Methods described in:
  Yrttimaa et al. (2019), https://doi.org/10.3390/rs11121423
  Yrttimaa et al. (2020), https://doi.org/10.1016/j.isprsjprs.2020.08.017

On the licence relationship: CC BY 4.0 section 3(a) permits distributing
adapted material under the adapter's own terms, provided attribution is given
and the original licence identified. This derivative is therefore distributed
under GPL-3.0-or-later, and the attribution above must be kept with any
